 ## Commands
 
 Please run the following commands, in the suggested order:
 
 - `git clone https://github.com/mlcommons/inference.git`
 - `cd [.../inference]/vision/medical_imaging/3d-unet-kits19`
-- `make setup`
 - `make build_docker`
 - `make launch_docker`
 - `make preprocess_data`
